      "doubt": "Agentenprüfung 1: open, Generic 'die Kultusgemeinde' is marked only where the context makes one body unambiguous; the letter shows an Austrian payment via Postsparkasse handled by the secretary but does not settle whether the Israelitische Kultusgemeinde Wien (GND 123152-2) or the Salzburg community, where Zweig still owned his house, is meant, and the organisation index has no Kultusgemeinde entry. Zweig's registered community in January 1935 is the missing evidence. Agentenprüfung 2: open, 'die Kultusgemeinde' names a concrete body Zweig owes a payment to, but the letter does not say whether the Vienna or the Salzburg community is meant (Zweig had just left Salzburg, the secretary works in Austria); whether the generic word counts as unambiguous, and if so whether c1 or c2, needs evidence about Zweig's community membership in January 1935 that the packet sources do not give. Kandidaten: c1: orgName ohne ref; c2: orgName http://d-nb.info/gnd/123152-2."
